					"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders",
					"host": [
						"{{baseUrl}}"
					],
					"path": [
						"orders"
					]
				},
				"description": "Creates a new order for the authenticated user.\n- Validates items list (quantity > 0, no duplicate product IDs).\n- Synchronously validates product existence, active status, and stock via Product Service gRPC.\n- Snapshots product name and unit price.\n- Commits order and line items inside a single database transaction.\n- Sets initial status to PENDING."
			},
